    "updated_at": "2016-09-13T08:21:22Z",
    "body": "Given https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1728#issuecomment-244285847 it seems this can be closed as \"worksforme\"? That is, since the behavior is supposed to be consistent for same-origin and cross-origin, we'll leave this as a TypeError?\n",
